connect with a partner.

00:30:07.400 --> 00:30:12.470
We start at the
partner access pricing,

00:30:12.470 --> 00:30:14.990
so whatever they charge
you to connect to us.

00:30:14.990 --> 00:30:18.680
And then there's a sliding
scale depending on how much data

00:30:18.680 --> 00:30:22.260
